UC59 ..> UC57 : <<include>>

note right of UC3
  4-Step Application:
  1. Applicant Info
  2. Project Details
  3. Land Use
  4. Requirements Upload
end note

note right of UC28
  Certificate Types:
  • CZ - Zoning Certification
  • CZC - Zoning Clearance
  • TUP - Temporary Use Permit
  • SUP - Special Use Permit
end note

note bottom of system
  Automated processes run via
  Laravel scheduler (cron jobs)
end note

legend right
  |= Actor |= Role |
  | Applicant | Citizens/Businesses |
  | Admin | Zoning Officer IV |
  | Super Admin | Zoning Administrator |
  | System | Automated Processes |
endlegend

